  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening SRHR by increasing access to Safe Abortion &amp; Contraception</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to IPAS. IPAS&apos;s mision is that women and girls have improved sexual and reproductive health rights through enhanced access and use of safe abortion and contraceptive care. IPAS will focus on three main pillars: 1)  enabling enviroment, 2)  high quality abortion and contraceptive care and 3) social support, knowledge and self-efficacy to access safe abortion and contraception.</narrative>
  </description>
